5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Before we rank the science, let us ask who is actually here to do the work.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m curious why the grant size looks the same but buys less! What costs are we still covering centrally?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I wonder if we should check what past projects actually delivered before deciding.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know where work in this field actually gets interrupted before we commit the money.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,- **Minako**: We must verify the current capacity of shared facilities before assuming they can absorb this award.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, a fair point. Let us see what the ledgers say about those frozen costs.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
