12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look into the closeout files of finished awards to see what actually delivered.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I’ll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation to see where things actually break down.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I’ll check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities, plus the staffing rolls for technical posts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
