35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: The staffing rolls are grim. Most technicians left, and our senior analysts are gone until autumn.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: The repository is finally fast! Deposits clear in weeks now, not a year. That’s a huge relief for data sharing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,- **Daisuke**: The closeout files are... discouraging. Several mechanism-focused awards ended with their central questions still unresolved.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,- **Takumi**: The spectroscopy suite sat idle for eleven weeks. That’s a massive risk for any project relying on it.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: The animal facility is accredited with vet cover, but glasshouses are booked solid for two more cycles.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, that aligns with my findings. We lack the technical hands to support complex, long-term biological work right now.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @Takumi, that idle suite worries me! Does that mean we can’t trust the spectroscopy timeline at all?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, I’m not sure. But the closeout files show mechanism-focused work often stalls, so I’m hesitant to trust it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, yes, the logs confirm the service lapse. But the field sites lost whole seasons to weather, so outdoor work is risky too.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, the spectroscopy risk is real, but the computing agreement covers simulation hours free. That might offset the lab delays.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, free computing is a blessing, but it cannot replace the missing technicians. We must respect the human limits.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @Minako, that’s smart! But if the glasshouses are full, does that block the plant work completely?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, the portfolio review shows breeding colonies overrun twice as often. If the glasshouses are full, that risk multiplies.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, the field sites lost seasons to weather, so outdoor work is risky. But the spectroscopy suite is the bigger immediate threat.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, not completely, but the two-cycle wait means any plant work starts late. We must factor that delay into the timeline.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, your caution is wise. We must not fund a project that outgrows the hands we currently possess.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, I agree! So if the plant work is delayed, maybe the soil cataloging is safer? It’s just data, no waiting!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, I hesitate. The closeout files show catalogue-style awards still drawing users a decade on, unlike the stalled mechanism work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, soil cataloging avoids the broken spectroscopy suite and the full glasshouses. It seems the safest path given our current constraints.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, precisely. The soil work avoids the idle spectroscopy and the booked glasshouses. It fits our current capacity best.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
